     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi<div><br></div><div>There seems to be more problems with the current unbindAll() bindAll() implementation (referring to <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msg/shiny-discuss/kHUI5E9ZDvE/1aZR0mdlVNUJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msg/shiny-discuss/kHUI5E9ZDvE/1aZR0mdlVNUJ&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792397232924000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Lna74nEVRjRqOuqrVFLbA\">https://groups.google.com/d/msg/shiny-discuss/kHUI5E9ZDvE/1aZR0mdlVNUJ</a>).</div><div><br></div><div>The values of uiOutput elements are currently getting reset whenever Shiny.bindAll() is getting called in the client logic. </div><div><br></div><div>Example:</div><div><br></div><div><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;overflow:auto;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45;padding:16px;background-color:rgb(247,247,247);border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-left-radius:3px;word-wrap:normal;word-break:normal;color:rgb(51,51,51)\">library(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">shiny</span>)\r\n\r\nrunApp(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">list</span>(\r\n    <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(237,106,67)\">ui</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">=</span> bootstrapPage(\r\n      uiOutput(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&quot;</span>testSlider1<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&quot;</span></span>), br(),\r\n      sliderInput(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&quot;</span>testSliderInput2<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&quot;</span></span>, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&quot;</span>testSliderInput2<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&quot;</span></span>, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,134,179)\">0</span>, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,134,179)\">100</span>, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,134,179)\">1</span>, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(237,106,67)\">step</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,134,179)\">1</span>), br(),\r\n\r\n      uiOutput(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&quot;</span>testText1<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&quot;</span></span>), br(),\r\n      textInput(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&quot;</span>testTextInput2<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&quot;</span></span>, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&quot;</span>testTextInput2<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&quot;</span></span>, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(237,106,67)\">value</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&quot;</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&quot;</span></span>)\r\n    ),\r\n    <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(237,106,67)\">server</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">function</span>(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">input</span>, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">output</span>, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">session</span>) {\r\n      <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">output</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">$</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">testSlider1</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">&lt;-</span> renderUI({\r\n        sliderInput(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&quot;</span>testSliderInput1<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&quot;</span></span>, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&quot;</span>testSliderInput1<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&quot;</span></span>, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,134,179)\">0</span>, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,134,179)\">100</span>, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,134,179)\">1</span>, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(237,106,67)\">step</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,134,179)\">1</span>)\r\n      })\r\n\r\n      <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">output</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">$</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">testText1</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">&lt;-</span> renderUI({\r\n        textInput(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&quot;</span>testTextInput1<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&quot;</span></span>, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&quot;</span>testTextInput1<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&quot;</span></span>, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(237,106,67)\">value</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&quot;</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&quot;</span></span>)\r\n      })\r\n    }\r\n))</pre></div><div><br></div><div>Open developers tools and call Shiny.unbindAll() followed by Shiny.bindAll() after altering any of the elements. Elements created using uiOutput will get reset whereas the others won&#39;t.</div><div><br></div><div>best</div><div><br></div><div>Thomas</div></div>"
